{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_clt_159_1","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_159","textTraditional":"一、九年，春，宋災。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_clt_159_2","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_159","textTraditional":"外災不志，此其志何也？故宋也。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_clt_159_3","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_159","textTraditional":"二、夏，季孫宿如晉。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_clt_159_4","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_159","textTraditional":"三、五月，辛酉，夫人姜氏薨。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_clt_159_5","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_159","textTraditional":"四、秋，八月，癸未，葬我小君穆姜。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_clt_159_6","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_159","textTraditional":"五、冬，公會晉侯、宋公、衞侯、曹伯、莒子、邾子、滕子、薛伯、小邾子、齊世子光伐鄭。十有二月，己亥，同盟於戲。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_clt_159_7","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_159","textTraditional":"不異言鄭，善得鄭也。不致，恥不能據鄭也。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_clt_159_8","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_159","textTraditional":"六、楚子伐鄭。","sentenceOrder":8}],"overrides":{}}